#chip 16F1829, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Value form: a value above 32 bits (8,000,000,000 cycles - computed in 64 bits)
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 8,000,000,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Flag As Bit
Dim Cnt As Byte
Dim X As Byte
Dim Y As Byte
Dim W1 As Word
Dim W2 As Word
Repeat For 4000000000 us
    Wait 10 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
